      "text": "office and duty of deacons, D&C 20:38, 57–59 (84:30, 111). to assist teachers, D&C 20:57. has no authority to baptize, administer sacrament, or lay on hands, D&C 20:58. ordination of deacons, D&C 20:60, 64. deacons and teachers appointed to watch over Church, D&C 84:111. need for one to preside over deacons, D&C 107:62. duty of president over deacons, D&C 107:85. keys given president of deacons and his counselors, D&C 124:142–43.",
